# macOS Finder metadata. Not anchored: these appear in any directory.
.DS_Store

# The built CLI (`make build` writes it here). Anchored to the repo root so it
# cannot shadow a future source directory that happens to share the name.
/videofx

# Sample footage used for benchmarking and stabilizer comparisons -- several
# gigabytes of 4K clips, plus the FIT activity file the telemetry effects are
# tested against. Far too large for the repo; keep it locally.
/test_videos/

# Scratch space for renders, captured diffs and anything else a working
# session produces. One fixed directory per checkout rather than a per-session
# temp path, so artifacts are always somewhere obvious to inspect and to
# delete (`scripts/vfx clean`). `.scratch/env` is the one thing meant to
# persist: local defaults such as VFX_E2E_VIDEO, which point at private
# footage and so must not reach the repo.
/.scratch/

# Local agent definitions. Kept out of the repo because they carry the private
# measurement history, including the comparison against a named commercial
# stabilizer that was deliberately stripped from the published text.
/.claude/agents/
